  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"166\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"166\">Join the Vizio Makeup Academy Ambassador Program?</strong></p><p data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"463\">Become part of a growing network of creators, students, and beauty enthusiasts who are passionate about professional makeup education. As a Vizio Ambassador, you’ll gain exclusive access to tools that elevate your brand, support your goals, and connect you with a respected name in the industry.</p><p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"678\">✨ <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"508\">Free access to selected Vizio courses</strong><br data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"511\">Get complimentary, unlimited access to some of our most popular online makeup courses — complete with certification — to sharpen your skills and grow at your own pace.</p><p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"897\">💰 <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"724\">Commission on every student you refer</strong><br data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"727\">Earn real income every time someone enrolls through your unique referral link. You’ll also receive a custom promo code to give your followers 50% off tuition — a win-win.</p><p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1114\">💄 <strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"950\">Exclusive discounts from top cosmetic brands</strong><br data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\">Use your certification or letter of recommendation to access up to 60% off pro brands like MAC, Urban Decay, and more — perfect for building your kit like a pro.</p><p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1355\">📣 <strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1173\">Featured opportunities across our social platforms</strong><br data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\">We love showcasing our ambassadors! You could be featured on our Instagram, TikTok, website, or email campaigns — helping you grow your presence and connect with a wider audience.</p><p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1602\">🎓 <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1411\">Partner with an accredited online makeup school</strong><br data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1414\">Vizio is an accredited academy recognized by California charter schools. By joining, you align with a trusted education provider and gain an extra boost of credibility in the beauty space.</p></div></div>",
